WEBVTT

00:00.797 --> 00:02.257
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

00:02.847 --> 00:04.047
<b>[WOMAN 1] Hey, guys,
did you hear?</b>

00:04.097 --> 00:06.137
<b>Everyone's saying
that she got hitched</b>

00:06.177 --> 00:07.557
<b>to the guy she hit it off with.</b>

00:07.597 --> 00:09.437
<b>Uh, yeah?</b>

00:09.477 --> 00:10.977
<b>[WOMAN 2] She is so lucky.</b>

00:11.017 --> 00:13.357
<b>-That guy was hot.
-I know, right?</b>

00:13.397 --> 00:15.397
<b>Nina, do you have
a crush on anyone?</b>

00:15.437 --> 00:16.647
<b>-Huh?
-Or more like,</b>

00:16.687 --> 00:18.777
<b>-how's it going with Gino?
-What? I--</b>

00:18.817 --> 00:20.907
<b>And then she turned bright red
out of nowhere.</b>

00:20.947 --> 00:22.737
<b>-[both laugh]
-I swear.</b>

00:22.777 --> 00:25.237
<b>Gino and I are
nothing more than friends, okay?</b>

00:25.277 --> 00:27.197
<b>I plan to live my life
for the blade</b>

00:27.237 --> 00:28.407
<b>and the blade only.</b>

00:28.457 --> 00:29.997
<b>Well, I guess
that's what it takes</b>

00:30.037 --> 00:31.497
<b>to be the Mad Dog's rival.</b>

00:31.537 --> 00:33.787
<b>You've only got time
for one sword in your life.</b>

00:33.837 --> 00:34.837
<b>-[approaching footsteps]
-Huh?</b>

00:34.877 --> 00:35.837
<b>[BOTH] Hmm?</b>

00:35.877 --> 00:36.917
<b>Hmm?</b>

00:44.757 --> 00:46.887
<b>[WOMAN 1] The Mad Dog,
she never changes.</b>

00:46.927 --> 00:49.477
<b>Do you think she was sparring
with the Sword God or something?</b>

00:51.767 --> 00:52.937
<b>Ha!</b>

00:52.977 --> 00:54.857
<b>I bet you could never
get yourself a man,</b>

00:54.897 --> 00:55.977
<b>even if you begged for it!</b>

00:56.027 --> 00:57.737
<b>Have fun marrying a sword</b>

00:57.777 --> 00:59.737
<b>and being a virgin
for the rest of your life!</b>

00:59.777 --> 01:00.987
<b>[women gasp]</b>

01:02.277 --> 01:03.697
<b>[smirks]</b>

01:03.737 --> 01:04.867
<b>[gasps]</b>

01:04.907 --> 01:05.867
<b>What was that?</b>

01:05.907 --> 01:07.987
<b>I'm sorry to disappoint you,</b>

01:08.697 --> 01:10.367
<b>but I've already
crossed that bridge.</b>

01:10.407 --> 01:11.577
<b>[gasps]</b>

01:11.617 --> 01:13.787
<b>-[women gasp]
-You're kidding. Who was it?</b>

01:14.377 --> 01:16.537
<b>Someone I'd known
since I was young.</b>

01:16.587 --> 01:18.917
<b>Yeah, and Rudeus was amazing!</b>

01:19.257 --> 01:22.297
<b>We became adventurers, then fled
the Demon Continent together.</b>

01:22.337 --> 01:23.967
<b>I was even lucky enough
to see him</b>

01:24.007 --> 01:25.637
<b>-land a blow on Orsted!
-[growls]</b>

01:25.677 --> 01:27.847
<b>Lies! The Dragon God's
way too strong.</b>

01:27.887 --> 01:29.847
<b>My dad said
it takes a true master</b>

01:29.887 --> 01:32.057
<b>to land so much
as a scratch on him!</b>

01:32.097 --> 01:33.227
<b>I'm not a liar.</b>

01:33.267 --> 01:35.687
<b>And I'd say
Rudeus is a true master.</b>

01:37.817 --> 01:40.437
<b>That's why I'm just not
a good match for him right now.</b>

01:41.277 --> 01:43.817
<b>I need to get way stronger
for him.</b>

01:50.077 --> 01:51.117
<b>[grunts in annoyance]</b>

01:52.707 --> 01:54.667
<b>[NINA] This "Rudeus"
can't be real.</b>

01:54.707 --> 01:56.917
<b>He's just a figment
of her imagination.</b>

01:58.627 --> 01:59.837
<b>[children laughing]</b>

01:59.877 --> 02:01.127
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

02:01.627 --> 02:03.087
<b>Did you say Rudeus?</b>

02:03.127 --> 02:04.967
<b>I did. He's an adventurer,</b>

02:05.007 --> 02:06.967
<b>but I bet you've never
heard of him, right?</b>

02:07.007 --> 02:08.177
<b>[ADVENTURERS] Hmm.</b>

02:08.217 --> 02:10.057
<b>[ADVENTURER 1]
Heard of him? Uh, listen.</b>

02:10.097 --> 02:12.477
<b>Every adventurer
has heard of Quagmire Rudeus.</b>

02:12.517 --> 02:13.517
<b>Eh?</b>

02:13.887 --> 02:15.847
<b>They say that Stepped Leader
tried to recruit him,</b>

02:15.897 --> 02:17.057
<b>more than once, even.</b>

02:17.397 --> 02:20.607
<b>It's true! I hear the guy killed
a red dragon on his own.</b>

02:20.647 --> 02:21.727
<b>Pretty crazy.</b>

02:21.817 --> 02:23.697
<b>[ADVENTURER 1]
A red dragon? By himself?</b>

02:23.737 --> 02:24.987
<b>[ADVENTURER 2]
That's something!</b>

02:25.777 --> 02:27.657
<b>[NINA] Did you find anything
on the adventurer</b>

02:27.697 --> 02:29.117
<b>I asked you to investigate?</b>

02:29.157 --> 02:30.617
<b>[MAN] Oh, yeah. He's famous,</b>

02:30.657 --> 02:32.157
<b>so it didn't take
too long at all.</b>

02:32.197 --> 02:33.657
<b>[gasps] Really?</b>

02:34.157 --> 02:35.997
<b>His full name is Rudeus Greyrat.</b>

02:36.037 --> 02:38.707
<b>Saint-class water mage
at the young age of five.</b>

02:38.747 --> 02:39.837
<b>When he was seven,</b>

02:40.087 --> 02:42.707
<b>he became Eris Boreas Greyrat's
tutor in Fittoa.</b>

02:43.337 --> 02:44.717
<b>He went missing after that,</b>

02:44.917 --> 02:47.637
<b>but lately, he's made a name
for himself as an adventurer,</b>

02:47.677 --> 02:49.217
<b>Quagmire Rudeus.</b>

02:49.257 --> 02:51.597
<b>Right now, he lives in Sharia,</b>

02:51.637 --> 02:54.177
<b>after the University of Magic
offered him a free ride.</b>

02:57.387 --> 02:58.727
<b>So he's real?</b>

02:59.187 --> 03:01.767
<b>Not some fantasy prince
Eris dreamed up?</b>

03:02.267 --> 03:03.277
<b>Hang on.</b>

03:04.397 --> 03:06.447
<b>Sure,
his reputation's impressive,</b>

03:06.487 --> 03:08.197
<b>but he's only an adventurer.</b>

03:08.237 --> 03:10.197
<b>Slaying a red dragon
single-handed</b>

03:10.237 --> 03:11.617
<b>sounds like a tall tale,</b>

03:11.657 --> 03:14.287
<b>and with a lame nickname
like "Quagmire,"</b>

03:14.327 --> 03:16.577
<b>maybe he's really
nothing special.</b>

03:16.617 --> 03:18.037
<b>Hey, I know!</b>

03:20.457 --> 03:22.047
<b>Just you wait, Eris.</b>

03:22.087 --> 03:23.797
<b>I'll beat Rudeus in a duel</b>

03:23.837 --> 03:26.717
<b>and drag him to your feet
as my prisoner.</b>

03:28.547 --> 03:30.297
<b>♪</b>

03:35.887 --> 03:37.347
<b>These are mages?</b>

03:37.387 --> 03:39.767
<b>They're a lot brawnier
than I thought they would be.</b>

03:39.807 --> 03:41.727
<b>[MAN IN CLOAK] I can find Rudeus
over there, then?</b>

03:42.357 --> 03:43.437
<b>Thank you.</b>

03:43.477 --> 03:44.897
<b>He said "Rudeus."</b>

03:49.067 --> 03:50.947
<b>[MAN IN CLOAK]
You seek to duel Rudeus as well?</b>

03:50.987 --> 03:52.277
<b>I do, yeah.</b>

03:52.317 --> 03:53.367
<b>Huh?</b>

03:57.117 --> 03:59.997
<b>I take it that you, sir,
are Quagmire Rudeus.</b>

04:00.037 --> 04:01.957
<b>I challenge you
to a matrimonial duel.</b>

04:01.997 --> 04:03.087
<b>[RUDEUS] Uh...</b>

04:05.957 --> 04:07.337
<b>Oh!</b>

04:07.377 --> 04:08.797
<b>Yeah, that's me.</b>

04:08.837 --> 04:10.217
<b>Might I ask who you are?</b>

04:10.257 --> 04:12.467
<b>-And is this one of those...
-[NINA] This is Rudeus?</b>

04:12.507 --> 04:13.507
<b>...that have been kinda
in vogue lately?</b>

04:13.547 --> 04:15.217
<b>[NINA]
He's in fairly good shape.</b>

04:15.257 --> 04:18.637
<b>But I don't sense any kind
of special aura or anything.</b>

04:18.687 --> 04:21.107
<b>He's not bad-looking, I guess.</b>

04:21.147 --> 04:23.647
<b>But there's nothing appealing
about him as a man.</b>

04:23.687 --> 04:25.777
<b>He's perfect for Eris.</b>

04:25.817 --> 04:28.487
<b>Great. I can wipe the floor
with this kid.</b>

04:28.527 --> 04:29.447
<b>[gasps]</b>

04:29.487 --> 04:31.357
<b>Now draw your weapon!</b>

04:31.407 --> 04:32.817
<b>[yells]</b>

04:32.867 --> 04:34.197
<b>[groaning]</b>

04:34.907 --> 04:37.327
<b>Well, better luck next year,
I suppose.</b>

04:38.537 --> 04:40.577
<b>How could a mage
beat a melee fighter</b>

04:40.617 --> 04:42.167
<b>at such close range?</b>

04:42.247 --> 04:45.627
<b>Well, I suppose that beast man
was much weaker than he looked.</b>

04:47.087 --> 04:48.377
<b>-Excuse me, sir.
-Hmm?</b>

04:48.417 --> 04:50.757
<b>I'm looking for a mage
named Rudeus Greyrat.</b>

04:50.797 --> 04:51.837
<b>Let me guess.</b>

04:52.217 --> 04:54.097
<b>You came a long way to challenge
the young mage too?</b>

04:54.137 --> 04:55.217
<b>Uh, yes.</b>

04:55.717 --> 04:56.677
<b>Hmm.</b>

04:57.217 --> 04:59.847
<b>Then you better get in line
with everyone else, miss.</b>

05:02.347 --> 05:03.307
<b>[gasps]</b>

05:03.347 --> 05:05.817
<b>[boisterous laughter]</b>

05:05.857 --> 05:07.607
<b>What's with the big line?</b>

05:07.647 --> 05:09.277
<b>Is there some kind of festival?</b>

05:09.317 --> 05:11.567
<b>No. We're all waiting
for our chance</b>

05:11.607 --> 05:13.697
<b>to challenge Rudeus Greyrat
to a duel.</b>

05:13.737 --> 05:15.197
<b>[DEMON] The whole lot of you?</b>

05:15.237 --> 05:16.907
<b>Any chance you'd let me
skip the line</b>

05:16.947 --> 05:18.197
<b>and take a crack at him first?</b>

05:18.247 --> 05:19.997
<b>You'd have to beat
everyone else in line</b>

05:20.037 --> 05:21.497
<b>before that'd ever happen!</b>

05:21.537 --> 05:24.247
<b>Fine idea. I like that!</b>

05:24.287 --> 05:27.087
<b>Now, come on,
charge at me, all of you!</b>

05:27.627 --> 05:31.217
<b>You may know me as the Immortal
Demon King Badigadi.</b>

05:31.257 --> 05:33.177
<b>I shall bestow the title of Hero</b>

05:33.217 --> 05:35.587
<b>on anyone
who manages to defeat me.</b>

05:35.637 --> 05:36.927
<b>You don't know
who you're messing with!</b>

05:36.967 --> 05:38.137
<b>Let's get him!</b>

05:38.177 --> 05:39.677
<b>[beastmen yelling]</b>

05:39.717 --> 05:41.477
<b>So you think you're hot shit,
do ya?!</b>

05:41.517 --> 05:43.137
<b>[battle cries]</b>

05:46.647 --> 05:48.397
<b>[yells]</b>

05:48.437 --> 05:49.607
<b>[sword clangs]</b>

05:50.107 --> 05:51.277
<b>[grunts weakly]</b>

05:51.317 --> 05:52.607
<b>[hushed chatter]</b>

05:52.647 --> 05:53.817
<b>[gasps]</b>

05:54.737 --> 05:56.237
<b>Ow, ow, ow.</b>

05:56.277 --> 05:57.327
<b>Huh?</b>

05:59.827 --> 06:01.497
<b>All right. Hope you're ready.</b>

06:01.537 --> 06:03.617
<b>Excellent. Go on.</b>

06:03.657 --> 06:04.827
<b>[whirring]</b>

06:16.637 --> 06:17.717
<b>[students exclaim]</b>

06:17.757 --> 06:20.007
<b>He beat that Demon King
in one strike.</b>

06:20.057 --> 06:22.847
<b>Is Eris really trying
to stand on equal footing</b>

06:22.887 --> 06:24.807
<b>with someone as powerful as him?</b>

06:39.737 --> 06:41.037
<b>[footsteps]</b>

06:42.117 --> 06:44.957
<b>-[whooshing]
-[Eris grunting]</b>

06:50.207 --> 06:52.457
<b>[panting]</b>

06:55.837 --> 06:57.257
<b>-[whooshing]
-[Eris grunting]</b>

06:59.137 --> 07:00.137
<b>[grunts]</b>

07:00.177 --> 07:01.467
<b>Huh?</b>

07:01.507 --> 07:02.597
<b>[grunting]</b>

07:09.897 --> 07:13.477
<b>[both grunting]</b>

07:23.747 --> 07:26.957
<b>Thank you
for traveling so far to be here.</b>

07:27.537 --> 07:29.917
<b>With those old bones,
it couldn't have been easy,</b>

07:30.377 --> 07:31.497
<b>Water God.</b>

07:31.537 --> 07:33.167
<b>These old bones agree.</b>

07:33.207 --> 07:36.587
<b>But a humble request from you
is a rarity I can't decline.</b>

07:36.627 --> 07:39.387
<b>Curiosity's a current
I struggle to resist.</b>

07:40.137 --> 07:42.137
<b>So, what would you
like me to teach,</b>

07:42.177 --> 07:43.677
<b>and to whom shall I teach it?</b>

07:46.017 --> 07:47.767
<b>I'm here at your request.</b>

07:51.727 --> 07:53.187
<b>-[dramatic sting]
-[gasps]</b>

07:56.187 --> 07:57.567
<b>[OLD WOMAN] Steady, Isolde.</b>

08:01.527 --> 08:05.617
<b>[♪ tense music playing]</b>

08:08.577 --> 08:09.747
<b>Took you long enough.</b>

08:10.287 --> 08:11.957
<b>This old lady is Reida Lia.</b>

08:11.997 --> 08:14.207
<b>She's the master
of the Water God Style.</b>

08:14.667 --> 08:17.377
<b>We meet again.
It's good to see you.</b>

08:17.417 --> 08:19.547
<b>Oh, Nina, is that you?</b>

08:19.587 --> 08:21.427
<b>You were but a child last time.</b>

08:21.467 --> 08:23.717
<b>I suppose
you've made Sword King by now?</b>

08:23.757 --> 08:26.347
<b>[NINA] No.
I still have much to learn.</b>

08:26.387 --> 08:29.097
<b>I feel confident
that I'm the fastest here,</b>

08:29.137 --> 08:30.227
<b>but I know my weakness.</b>

08:30.267 --> 08:31.897
<b>I'm not the strongest.</b>

08:31.937 --> 08:33.767
<b>[in hushes voice] Hey, sit down.</b>

08:33.807 --> 08:35.477
<b>Where are your manners?</b>

08:35.517 --> 08:38.777
<b>Eris, Reida here will teach you
everything there is to know</b>

08:38.817 --> 08:40.277
<b>about the Water God Style,</b>

08:40.317 --> 08:42.027
<b>so pay close attention.</b>

08:43.027 --> 08:44.447
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

08:44.947 --> 08:47.617
<b>This girl is like
an unbroken mustang.</b>

08:48.077 --> 08:49.827
<b>I hate to disappoint you,
old friend,</b>

08:49.867 --> 08:52.377
<b>but she's not cut out
for the Water God style.</b>

08:52.417 --> 08:53.497
<b>Sorry.</b>

08:53.537 --> 08:55.337
<b>Please, like I don't
already know that.</b>

08:55.377 --> 08:58.337
<b>Then what do you propose
I teach the girl?</b>

08:58.377 --> 09:00.297
<b>[GAL] You don't have to
teach her anything.</b>

09:00.337 --> 09:02.587
<b>Just spar with her
using your style.</b>

09:02.637 --> 09:03.637
<b>Really?</b>

09:04.597 --> 09:07.717
<b>I'm confused.
Was this invitation a ploy</b>

09:07.757 --> 09:09.807
<b>to have your beastling
assassinate me?</b>

09:09.847 --> 09:11.557
<b>No, of course not.</b>

09:11.597 --> 09:12.897
<b>Why would I murder an old harpy</b>

09:12.937 --> 09:14.977
<b>who's already got one foot
in the grave?</b>

09:15.477 --> 09:17.727
<b>Well, then, go ahead
and enlighten me.</b>

09:17.767 --> 09:18.987
<b>If she's not fighting me,</b>

09:19.027 --> 09:20.737
<b>which wolf
are you throwing the girl to?</b>

09:20.777 --> 09:21.817
<b>[chuckles]</b>

09:22.277 --> 09:24.487
<b>Our beastling Eris here
is hell-bent</b>

09:24.527 --> 09:26.827
<b>on taking down
the Dragon God Orsted.</b>

09:26.867 --> 09:27.867
<b>[gasps]</b>

09:28.497 --> 09:29.997
<b>You're kidding!</b>

09:30.037 --> 09:31.957
<b>The Dragon God himself?</b>

09:33.827 --> 09:36.207
<b>I can't fault her
for being ambitious.</b>

09:36.667 --> 09:38.127
<b>You think she's up to the task?</b>

09:38.707 --> 09:40.717
<b>If anyone's up for it, it's her.</b>

09:40.757 --> 09:42.627
<b>She knows it too.</b>

09:43.217 --> 09:45.927
<b>I'm glad you're confident,
but know this.</b>

09:45.967 --> 09:48.007
<b>I refuse to coddle
a talentless hack</b>

09:48.057 --> 09:50.477
<b>who can't swim
in treacherous waters.</b>

09:50.517 --> 09:52.057
<b>You'll face my apprentice first,</b>

09:52.097 --> 09:54.097
<b>and if you're good enough
to beat her handily,</b>

09:54.137 --> 09:55.647
<b>I'll agree to train you both.</b>

09:58.267 --> 10:00.527
<b>[ISOLDE] I've heard of
your circumstances.</b>

10:01.187 --> 10:04.407
<b>Greetings, friends.
I'm Water King Isolde Cluel.</b>

10:04.947 --> 10:06.447
<b>It's a pleasure to meet you.</b>

10:07.327 --> 10:09.237
<b>And I'm Sword Saint Nina Farion.</b>

10:09.287 --> 10:10.497
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

10:10.537 --> 10:12.367
<b>Call me Eris Greyrat.</b>

10:14.457 --> 10:16.707
<b>I'll play along
since my master asked me to,</b>

10:16.747 --> 10:18.127
<b>but here's the reality.</b>

10:18.537 --> 10:20.957
<b>Since I'm king-ranked
and you're only saint-ranked,</b>

10:21.007 --> 10:23.007
<b>I imagine this won't be
much of a fight at all.</b>

10:25.967 --> 10:27.137
<b>I suppose not.</b>

10:27.547 --> 10:29.137
<b>Please be gentle with us.</b>

10:29.177 --> 10:30.307
<b>[huffs]</b>

10:30.347 --> 10:31.637
<b>[chuckles]</b>

10:32.677 --> 10:33.927
<b>[♪ intense music playing]</b>

10:33.977 --> 10:35.477
<b>[bokken thwacking]</b>

10:35.517 --> 10:38.727
<b>[Eris grunting]</b>

10:45.487 --> 10:46.527
<b>[grunts]</b>

10:58.957 --> 11:00.247
<b>[gasps in pain]</b>

11:02.337 --> 11:06.637
<b>[groaning]</b>

11:08.967 --> 11:10.047
<b>[gasps]</b>

11:10.097 --> 11:11.217
<b>Hmm.</b>

11:15.427 --> 11:17.227
<b>Whenever you're ready.</b>

11:19.477 --> 11:21.727
<b>[whooshes]</b>

11:22.227 --> 11:23.567
<b>[gasps]</b>

11:23.607 --> 11:25.857
<b>[breathes shakily, groans]</b>

11:30.777 --> 11:32.197
<b>I just beat her.</b>

11:35.957 --> 11:38.497
<b>Funny how that turned out,
wouldn't you say?</b>

11:38.537 --> 11:40.917
<b>There's nothing funny about it,
so I would not.</b>

11:41.497 --> 11:44.877
<b>Still, I suppose
this is a favorable start.</b>

11:44.917 --> 11:46.877
<b>What do you say, my dear?</b>

11:46.917 --> 11:50.047
<b>Would you like to study a few
Water God tricks with me?</b>

11:50.087 --> 11:51.597
<b>[NINA] No, I appreciate it,</b>

11:51.637 --> 11:54.097
<b>but I would prefer to stay
focused on the Sword God Style.</b>

11:54.137 --> 11:55.597
<b>Oh, is that so?</b>

11:55.637 --> 11:57.267
<b>Then you've got the right idea.</b>

11:57.637 --> 11:59.807
<b>Well, I can't believe
I'm saying this,</b>

11:59.847 --> 12:01.107
<b>but perhaps the three of them</b>

12:01.147 --> 12:03.477
<b>would benefit from
crossing blades for a while</b>

12:03.517 --> 12:04.647
<b>and helping one another?</b>

12:04.687 --> 12:06.277
<b>Yep. Might as well.</b>

12:07.187 --> 12:10.277
<b>Right. Train with your
normal masters in the morning,</b>

12:10.317 --> 12:12.907
<b>then train together
right around sunset.</b>

12:12.947 --> 12:15.157
<b>-Sir.
-[ERIS] I understand.</b>

12:16.617 --> 12:18.787
<b>[sword saints grunting]</b>

12:19.707 --> 12:21.037
<b>[Eris panting]</b>

12:25.207 --> 12:27.127
<b>[yells]</b>

12:30.047 --> 12:31.717
<b>-[Eris yelps]
-[crashes]</b>

12:33.297 --> 12:34.387
<b>[groans]</b>

12:35.217 --> 12:36.967
<b>It seems I've won yet again.</b>

12:37.927 --> 12:41.607
<b>You consistently beat Eris,
I consistently beat you,</b>

12:41.647 --> 12:43.267
<b>and she always beats me.</b>

12:43.307 --> 12:45.017
<b>We'll never have a clear winner.</b>

12:45.067 --> 12:46.317
<b>Huh.</b>

12:46.857 --> 12:49.147
<b>I suppose
we could talk it over together?</b>

12:49.187 --> 12:51.317
<b>What would be the point of that?</b>

12:51.357 --> 12:53.197
<b>In the Water God Style,
when training,</b>

12:53.237 --> 12:55.527
<b>we help each other improve
by sharing advice.</b>

12:55.577 --> 12:56.907
<b>Ah.</b>

12:56.947 --> 12:58.707
<b>I'd try it, I guess.</b>

13:01.037 --> 13:02.207
<b>Sure thing.</b>

13:02.537 --> 13:03.587
<b>Let's do it.</b>

13:03.627 --> 13:05.587
<b>-Hmm?
-That settles it.</b>

13:05.627 --> 13:07.547
<b>-Now, then.
-[sword saint yells]</b>

13:07.587 --> 13:09.257
<b>-Come on, I can't hear you!
-[sword saints grunting]</b>

13:09.297 --> 13:12.087
<b>Is there anywhere
a little quieter we could go?</b>

13:12.467 --> 13:14.257
<b>Let me think.</b>

13:18.847 --> 13:20.927
<b>[ISOLDE] Please allow me
to be perfectly frank.</b>

13:21.437 --> 13:24.017
<b>Eris,
you just radiate animosity.</b>

13:24.057 --> 13:27.267
<b>The practitioners of my style
are quite sensitive to it,</b>

13:27.317 --> 13:28.897
<b>which helps us
counter your attacks</b>

13:28.937 --> 13:30.687
<b>because we know
when they're coming.</b>

13:30.737 --> 13:31.987
<b>That's all well and good,</b>

13:32.197 --> 13:34.697
<b>but how do you expect me
to change what I feel inside?</b>

13:34.987 --> 13:36.577
<b>That's a fair point.</b>

13:37.077 --> 13:39.617
<b>Hey, you hardly ever show
any animosity.</b>

13:39.657 --> 13:41.077
<b>How do you control yourself?</b>

13:41.117 --> 13:43.247
<b>I'm not sure what to tell you.</b>

13:43.287 --> 13:44.457
<b>A duel's just a matter of</b>

13:44.497 --> 13:46.247
<b>moving faster
than your opponent.</b>

13:46.287 --> 13:48.167
<b>Animosity only gets in the way.</b>

13:48.917 --> 13:50.967
<b>Mm. I don't understand.</b>

13:51.007 --> 13:55.137
<b>[sighs] And I don't understand
how I can't beat you in a fight.</b>

13:55.177 --> 13:56.847
<b>Really bums me out.</b>

13:57.927 --> 13:59.677
<b>[ERIS] It's because
I strategically trick you</b>

13:59.717 --> 14:02.227
<b>-into moving after I do.
-Huh?</b>

14:02.847 --> 14:04.807
<b>Ruijerd's the one
who taught me how.</b>

14:04.847 --> 14:07.017
<b>It's all about
using things like eye contact</b>

14:07.057 --> 14:08.937
<b>to make people
jump into action first</b>

14:08.977 --> 14:11.027
<b>or to scare them
into hesitating a bit.</b>

14:11.067 --> 14:13.527
<b>You said "Ruijerd"? Who's he?</b>

14:13.817 --> 14:15.567
<b>He was my original master.</b>

14:15.947 --> 14:16.987
<b>In other words,</b>

14:17.407 --> 14:19.117
<b>you're deliberately manipulating
your opponent's actions</b>

14:19.157 --> 14:21.497
<b>so that you can manipulate
the outcome of the fight?</b>

14:21.537 --> 14:22.577
<b>That's right.</b>

14:22.617 --> 14:23.997
<b>[ISOLDE, NINA] Hmm.</b>

14:24.787 --> 14:27.037
<b>[ISOLDE] I see.
And you do this to me too?</b>

14:27.077 --> 14:30.207
<b>Well, I try, but I can't ever
get you to move a muscle.</b>

14:30.247 --> 14:32.627
<b>I've been trained not to react
to such tricks.</b>

14:32.667 --> 14:33.797
<b>[grunts in annoyance]</b>

14:33.837 --> 14:35.587
<b>The next time we face off,</b>

14:35.637 --> 14:37.717
<b>you should try
restraining your hostility.</b>

14:38.927 --> 14:40.257
<b>I can try that.</b>

14:41.307 --> 14:43.727
<b>So, what do you think
I should focus on next?</b>

14:43.767 --> 14:45.727
<b>That's a good question.</b>

14:46.057 --> 14:47.857
<b>Have you considered
asking your master</b>

14:47.897 --> 14:49.227
<b>what you should try next?</b>

14:49.267 --> 14:51.527
<b>Yeah, if I could get
a straight answer out of him,</b>

14:51.567 --> 14:54.147
<b>we wouldn't even
be having this conversation.</b>

14:57.407 --> 14:58.527
<b>[sighs]</b>

14:58.777 --> 15:01.747
<b>Now that we shared our advice,
what good did it do?</b>

15:02.077 --> 15:03.787
<b>[wind howling]</b>

15:04.747 --> 15:06.667
<b>-Hey.
-[NINA] What?</b>

15:06.707 --> 15:08.587
<b>Why is there a coat
hanging on your wall</b>

15:08.627 --> 15:09.997
<b>that looks like Ghislaine's?</b>

15:10.037 --> 15:12.087
<b>Huh? You don't know?</b>

15:12.337 --> 15:13.337
<b>We have them made for us</b>

15:13.417 --> 15:15.337
<b>when we become ranked
as Sword Saints.</b>

15:15.377 --> 15:17.887
<b>I don't wear it much
because it's not my style.</b>

15:17.927 --> 15:19.757
<b>Then why don't I have one?</b>

15:19.797 --> 15:21.847
<b>Hunt one down
if you want it so badly.</b>

15:21.887 --> 15:24.427
<b>-I doubt it would be difficult.
-[grumbles]</b>

15:24.927 --> 15:26.727
<b>[gasps] What do you mean,
"hunt one"?</b>

15:26.767 --> 15:28.687
<b>In order to become
a Sword Saint,</b>

15:28.727 --> 15:30.687
<b>you hunt a monster as your test.</b>

15:30.727 --> 15:33.437
<b>Then you make a coat
from the pelt of that monster,</b>

15:33.477 --> 15:35.527
<b>and that's how
you prove you're worthy.</b>

15:35.567 --> 15:38.107
<b>And where can we find
these monsters?</b>

15:38.147 --> 15:40.527
<b>By the waterfall
in the forest west of here.</b>

15:40.577 --> 15:41.737
<b>It's not that far.</b>

15:41.777 --> 15:43.617
<b>Good, then show me the way!</b>

15:43.657 --> 15:44.747
<b>[gasps]</b>

15:46.037 --> 15:47.617
<b>-[ISOLDE] Pardon me.
-Uh?</b>

15:47.657 --> 15:50.167
<b>Would I be intruding
if I tagged along?</b>

15:50.207 --> 15:52.797
<b>[gasps] Mm.</b>

15:54.207 --> 15:55.717
<b>[sighs deeply]</b>

16:00.337 --> 16:02.137
<b>[horse neighs]</b>

16:07.937 --> 16:09.807
<b>[NINA] I'm sure you'll both
fare well against them,</b>

16:09.847 --> 16:11.557
<b>but please be careful.</b>

16:11.607 --> 16:14.107
<b>Their numbers are plentiful,
and they're fast.</b>

16:14.147 --> 16:16.237
<b>I haven't fought many monsters
in my day,</b>

16:16.277 --> 16:18.697
<b>so I'm actually more nervous
than I expected.</b>

16:18.737 --> 16:21.317
<b>It's easier
than parrying that animal there.</b>

16:21.367 --> 16:23.697
<b>Hey, where did the monsters go?</b>

16:23.737 --> 16:25.497
<b>[NINA] They'll come
when we build a fire.</b>

16:25.537 --> 16:26.827
<b>Just be patient.</b>

16:33.787 --> 16:36.417
<b>Hmm. Why is this not working?</b>

16:36.457 --> 16:39.877
<b>Let the great protection of fire
converge where thou seekest.</b>

16:39.927 --> 16:43.047
<b>I call forth the bold heat
of a torch here and now.</b>

16:43.097 --> 16:44.347
<b>Fireball, go.</b>

16:46.387 --> 16:47.387
<b>[exclaims]</b>

16:48.097 --> 16:50.557
<b>What the--
Since when do you know magic?</b>

16:50.597 --> 16:52.227
<b>Since Rudeus showed me.</b>

16:52.647 --> 16:54.767
<b>He also taught me
how to read and write.</b>

16:54.817 --> 16:56.987
<b>[NINA] You know magic,
reading, and writing?</b>

16:57.017 --> 16:58.777
<b>He taught Ghislaine as well.</b>

16:58.817 --> 17:00.397
<b>When we went
to the Demon Continent,</b>

17:00.447 --> 17:02.237
<b>he taught me
how to speak Demon God.</b>

17:02.617 --> 17:04.327
<b>He could also speak
with the beast people</b>

17:04.367 --> 17:05.617
<b>of the Great Forest.</b>

17:06.367 --> 17:08.497
<b>He's the most amazing person
I know.</b>

17:08.537 --> 17:09.577
<b>[NINA] Hmm?</b>

17:12.537 --> 17:13.837
<b>-By the way--
-[grunts tensely]</b>

17:15.917 --> 17:18.417
<b>[♪ dramatic music playing]</b>

17:18.457 --> 17:21.417
<b>[monsters growling]</b>

17:21.467 --> 17:23.257
<b>You got what you asked for.</b>

17:32.637 --> 17:33.767
<b>Huh?</b>

17:35.607 --> 17:37.527
<b>Oh, great. Eris is letting
a bunch of them through.</b>

17:37.937 --> 17:38.977
<b>[gasps]</b>

17:42.237 --> 17:43.357
<b>[grunts]</b>

17:44.107 --> 17:45.447
<b>[grunts]</b>

17:46.447 --> 17:47.407
<b>[grunts]</b>

17:47.447 --> 17:48.947
<b>[panting]</b>

17:52.457 --> 17:53.497
<b>[grunts]</b>

17:56.127 --> 17:57.667
<b>[growling]</b>

17:58.997 --> 18:01.667
<b>[yells]</b>

18:01.717 --> 18:03.047
<b>[sword slashes]</b>

18:15.227 --> 18:17.357
<b>[ISOLDE] I must say,
I greatly enjoyed this.</b>

18:17.977 --> 18:20.227
<b>I've never had the chance
to train and talk</b>

18:20.277 --> 18:21.317
<b>and go monster hunting</b>

18:21.397 --> 18:23.147
<b>with a group of girls
like you before,</b>

18:23.187 --> 18:26.447
<b>who can wield a sword,
and almost as good as I can.</b>

18:26.487 --> 18:28.367
<b>I feel the exact same way.</b>

18:28.907 --> 18:29.947
<b>[huffs]</b>

18:33.247 --> 18:35.577
<b>[ISOLDE] Well, then,
this is where I leave you.</b>

18:35.627 --> 18:37.747
<b>[NINA] Thank you
for everything today.</b>

18:37.787 --> 18:40.207
<b>It was nice. I'm glad we talked.</b>

18:40.247 --> 18:41.587
<b>Same to you.</b>

18:41.627 --> 18:44.167
<b>I already feel myself improving
from our training.</b>

18:44.547 --> 18:46.047
<b>[both chuckle]</b>

18:48.887 --> 18:51.717
<b>Uh, I learned a lot
from you as well, Eris.</b>

18:51.767 --> 18:53.137
<b>Thank you.</b>

18:53.177 --> 18:55.307
<b>[ERIS] I'll get a hit in
on you next time.</b>

18:56.017 --> 18:57.727
<b>I look forward to you trying.</b>

18:57.767 --> 18:59.977
<b>Bye. Have a good night, you two.</b>

19:09.527 --> 19:10.697
<b>What do you want?</b>

19:10.867 --> 19:13.157
<b>Listen, you wanna know
how to keep your animosity</b>

19:13.197 --> 19:14.247
<b>from showing, right?</b>

19:14.747 --> 19:16.367
<b>So? Why do you care?</b>

19:16.407 --> 19:18.917
<b>Well, you should try soaking
in a hot bath,</b>

19:18.957 --> 19:21.337
<b>clean yourself up,
eat a nice dinner,</b>

19:21.377 --> 19:23.337
<b>and then climb
into a soft, warm bed</b>

19:23.377 --> 19:24.917
<b>thinking only
about your boyfriend</b>

19:24.967 --> 19:26.587
<b>until you drift off to sleep.</b>

19:26.927 --> 19:27.967
<b>Why would I do that?</b>

19:28.257 --> 19:30.177
<b>And what does Rudeus have to do
with any of this?</b>

19:31.967 --> 19:33.177
<b>A lot.</b>

19:33.387 --> 19:35.927
<b>When you talk about him,
you seem way less murderous.</b>

19:35.977 --> 19:37.177
<b>Give it a shot.</b>

19:41.147 --> 19:42.527
<b>Believe me, he'll dump you</b>

19:42.567 --> 19:44.277
<b>if you let yourself
get too dirty.</b>

19:48.867 --> 19:50.027
<b>[sniffs]</b>

19:50.067 --> 19:51.197
<b>[gags]</b>

19:52.577 --> 19:55.787
<b>Well, she might have a point,
honestly.</b>

19:55.827 --> 19:58.497
<b>Rudeus was fussy about laundry.</b>

19:58.537 --> 19:59.957
<b>[gasps]</b>

20:19.187 --> 20:20.227
<b>Begin!</b>

20:35.447 --> 20:36.617
<b>[gasps]</b>

20:40.367 --> 20:41.537
<b>-[thwacks]
-[Isolde gasps]</b>

20:41.577 --> 20:42.997
<b>[bokken clatters]</b>

20:43.997 --> 20:45.297
<b>[body thuds]</b>

20:46.247 --> 20:48.297
<b>♪</b>

20:57.597 --> 20:58.637
<b>[sighs]</b>

21:05.647 --> 21:07.527
<b>[chuckles]</b>

21:12.487 --> 21:13.737
<b>For all their differences,</b>

21:13.777 --> 21:16.117
<b>they appear to have
been matched quite evenly.</b>

21:16.157 --> 21:17.867
<b>It's funny
how the balance of power</b>

21:17.907 --> 21:19.617
<b>between them hasn't changed,</b>

21:19.657 --> 21:21.617
<b>and yet they have managed
to each win</b>

21:21.657 --> 21:24.837
<b>at least one bout in three,
when they couldn't before.</b>

21:24.877 --> 21:27.747
<b>Yes. It would seem
they're improving.</b>

21:27.797 --> 21:30.007
<b>This is exactly what you wanted,
isn't it?</b>

21:30.667 --> 21:31.837
<b>Hmm.</b>

21:32.427 --> 21:35.637
<b>Well, I suppose
they're getting a bit better.</b>

21:35.677 --> 21:37.847
<b>Hey, holding back is hard.</b>

21:38.387 --> 21:39.977
<b>Now I get to fight Nina,
don't I?</b>

21:40.017 --> 21:41.517
<b>Nah, we're done for today.</b>

21:41.557 --> 21:42.767
<b>That's not fair!</b>

21:42.807 --> 21:44.437
<b>If I'm remembering
this correctly,</b>

21:44.477 --> 21:46.857
<b>we agreed to talk things over
once we finished.</b>

21:46.897 --> 21:48.607
<b>We did, didn't we? [chuckles]</b>

21:48.647 --> 21:49.567
<b>[gasps]</b>

21:49.607 --> 21:51.237
<b>Just remember to take a bath</b>

21:51.277 --> 21:53.237
<b>before we get back together,
please.</b>

21:57.367 --> 21:58.907
<b>Yeah, yeah, I will.</b>

22:04.957 --> 22:07.127
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>
